# Fast, commit-safe checks only. The full suite (typecheck, tests,
# workshop integrity) runs in CI; pre-push-validate adds docs lint,
# cspell, mirror-drift, code-span-wrap, and build:check at push time
# (post-fix-validate adds mirror-drift and code-span-wrap only).
# build:check's `git diff` deadlocked here against the in-progress
# commit's index.lock (see #1007).
pnpm run lint:precommit
